  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/ctrl1/). VERDICT: OBSOLETE. P4 review 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f: pyproject.toml [tool.mypy] enable_error_code omits explicit-override, and lines 130-134 record why. Commit 12c4dbc65e (2026-07-19, after this item was filed) dropped it, citing 289 errors, a stricter-than-pyright default, the typing_extensions dependency on 3.10, and low bug value. 0 @override uses in packages/*/src. The item's premise that the code is 'already proposed in W4's list; this sweep lets the gate close' was superseded. mypy's default `override` check (2 errors in the baseline) already catches incompatible subclass signatures. Close as wont_do unless the owner reverses 12c4dbc65e. MECHANISM: explicit-override deliberately dropped from the mypy bar (12c4dbc65e, WI-rokup refinement; pyproject.toml:130-134). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-zogud. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 204a
